{"id":"512abfcc793a6632","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-separated-sheaf-eff.md","title":"thm-separated-sheaf-eff","display":"thm-separated-sheaf-eff","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-thm-separated-sheaf-eff","aliases":["16-thm-separated-sheaf-eff","16-separated-sheaf-eff"],"display":"thm-separated-sheaf-eff","depends_on":["[[16-df-separated]]","[[16-df-sheaf]]","[[16-df-nucleus]]","[[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]","[[16-thm-sets-embedding-eff]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-separated-sheaf-eff"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-separated-sheaf-eff</span><span>16-separated-sheaf-eff</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-separated-sheaf-eff"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e3878d9cc72edc34\" href=\"?note=e3878d9cc72edc34\" title=\"16-df-separated\">16-df-separated</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dc7a86008fec71df\" href=\"?note=dc7a86008fec71df\" title=\"16-df-sheaf\">16-df-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e\" href=\"?note=7b9d7a3ecba84e9e\" title=\"16-df-nucleus\">16-df-nucleus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" href=\"?note=198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" title=\"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff\">16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c18e2a4a9af5e4cb\" href=\"?note=c18e2a4a9af5e4cb\" title=\"16-thm-sets-embedding-eff\">16-thm-sets-embedding-eff</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eff}\">\\(\\mathrm{Eff}\\)</span> (有效拓扑斯)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_{\\neg\\neg}=\\neg_\\Omega\\neg_\\Omega\">\\(j_{\\neg\\neg}=\\neg_\\Omega\\neg_\\Omega\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e\" href=\"?note=7b9d7a3ecba84e9e\" title=\"16-df-nucleus\">16-df-nucleus</a> 构造的双重否定nucleus；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\">\\(\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}\\)</span> 的嵌入取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" href=\"?note=198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" title=\"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff\">16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c18e2a4a9af5e4cb\" href=\"?note=c18e2a4a9af5e4cb\" title=\"16-thm-sets-embedding-eff\">16-thm-sets-embedding-eff</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sep}_{j_{\\neg\\neg}}(\\mathrm{Eff})\">\\(\\mathbf{Sep}_{j_{\\neg\\neg}}(\\mathrm{Eff})\\)</span> (分离对象范畴)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Sh}_{j_{\\neg\\neg}}(\\mathrm{Eff})\">\\(\\mathbf{Sh}_{j_{\\neg\\neg}}(\\mathrm{Eff})\\)</span> (层对象范畴)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\">\\(\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}\\)</span> (范畴)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}separated\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}eff}\\vdash\n\\mathbf{Sep}_{j_{\\neg\\neg}}(\\mathrm{Eff})\\simeq\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\n\\land\\;\\mathbf{Sh}_{j_{\\neg\\neg}}(\\mathrm{Eff})\\simeq\\mathbf{Set}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}separated\\text{-}sheaf\\text{-}eff}\\vdash\n\\mathbf{Sep}_{j_{\\neg\\neg}}(\\mathrm{Eff})\\simeq\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\n\\land\\;\\mathbf{Sh}_{j_{\\neg\\neg}}(\\mathrm{Eff})\\simeq\\mathbf{Set}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源Theorem6.2.8 pp.391–392 (PDF411–412)，已核对两方向原书证明：separated由双重否定闭对角刻画并与canonical assemblies对应；sheaf方向对closed单值关系用共同实现元证明unique choice，反向借sheaf单位的稠密且闭单态得到常集合反射单位为同构。这里报告来源证明审阅，不声称已独立重建所有sheafification辅助定理。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>两个结论分别涉及“延拓至多唯一”和“延拓存在且唯一”，不能把 separated 与 sheaf 混同。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-separated","status":"resolved","id":"e3878d9cc72edc34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-separated]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"dc7a86008fec71df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-nucleus","status":"resolved","id":"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-nucleus]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff","status":"resolved","id":"198e3b21cd4c6cd2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-sets-embedding-eff","status":"resolved","id":"c18e2a4a9af5e4cb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-sets-embedding-eff]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-nucleus","status":"resolved","id":"7b9d7a3ecba84e9e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$j_{\\neg\\neg}=\\neg_\\Omega\\neg_\\Omega$ 是 [[16-df-nucleus]] 构造的双重否定nucleus；$\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}$ 与 $\\mathbf{Set}$ 的嵌入取 [[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-